                "kind": "text",
                "value": "), the AsciiDoc processor will leave the attribute reference behind. If you undefine an attribute on the same line as other text (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "{set:attribute-no-more!}"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
